Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.17,0:00:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,完蛋了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,dwdwdwd僅分享於anime字幕論壇 修正請保留此項
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,能用傳送想想辦法嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.53,0:00:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我的傳送距離最多只有30米
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.77,0:00:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,這種高度之下根本沒有意義啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,蕾茜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這個速度應該就沒事了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.41,0:00:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,蕾茜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.03,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.55,0:00:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,痛死了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡是…烏洛波羅斯的軀體上？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.86,0:00:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是說遊戲開始了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.03,0:00:49.03,opcn,,0,0,0,,---- op對幀 ----
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.25,0:00:52.55,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&B4583C&\blur3\fad(100,100)}遊戲開始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.55,0:00:54.20,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&B4583C&\blur3\fad(100,100)}無需他物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:56.56,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}孤注一擲便可
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.56,0:00:59.76,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}你已沉淪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.76,0:01:03.31,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&B4583C&\blur3\fad(100,100)}坦率承認便能解脫
