Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.31,0:01:51.05,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&EB9277&\blur3\fad(100,100)}世界如此不公 那便將其顛覆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.05,0:01:52.93,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}循環無休無止
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.93,0:01:54.38,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}勝率一半一半
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:01:56.17,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}不願知曉未來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.17,0:01:57.59,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}劇情陣陣刺痛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.59,0:01:59.38,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}無懼前功盡棄
